        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palmdale%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s name comes from settlers who mistook Joshua trees for palms and named the settlement after them.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palmdale%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1962 Palmdale became the first incorporated city in Antelope Valley, a milestone celebrated on August 24.",
